of the Sea of Chinnereth to the Sea of the Arabah (the Salt Sea), eastward through Beth-jeshimoth, and southward below the slopes of Pisgah.","from":2},{"book":"JDG","chapter":1,"verse":27,"verseEnd":27,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"At that time Manasseh failed to drive out the inhabitants of Beth-shean, Taanach, Dor, Ibleam, Megiddo, and their villages; for the Canaanites were determined to dwell in that land.","from":2},{"book":"JDG","chapter":3,"verse":3,"verseEnd":3,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"the five rulers of the Philistines, all the Canaanites, the Sidonians, and the Hivites who lived in the mountains of Lebanon from Mount Baal-hermon to Lebo-hamath.","from":3},{"book":"JDG","chapter":7,"verse":12,"verseEnd":12,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"Now the Midianites, Amalekites, and all the other people of the east had settled in the valley like a swarm of locusts, and their camels were as countless as the sand on the seashore.","from":4},{"book":"2SA","chapter":8,"verse":4,"verseEnd":4,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"David captured from him a thousand chariots, seven thousand charioteers, and twenty thousand foot soldiers, and he hamstrung all the horses except a hundred he kept for the chariots.","from":6},{"book":"GEN","chapter":10,"verse":15,"verseEnd":15,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"And Canaan was the father of Sidon his firstborn, and of the Hittites,","from":8}],"notes":[],"groups":[]},"10-15":{"people":[{"id":"joshua-h3091g","name":"Joshua","kind":"person","brief":"A judge","count":4,"firstVerse":10},{"id":"moses-h4872","name":"Moses","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Amram","count":2,"firstVerse":12},{"id":"israel-h3478","name":"Israel","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Isaac","count":2,"firstVerse":13}],"places":[{"id":"hazor-h2674g","name":"Hazor","kind":"place","brief":"","count":3,"firstVerse":10}],"words":[{"base":"H2674","lemma":"חָצוֹר","tr":"cha·tsor","gloss":"Hazor","lang":"h","inPassage":4,"uses":18},{"base":"H3091","lemma":"יְהוֹשׁוּעַ","tr":"ye·ho·shu·a","gloss":"Joshua","lang":"h","inPassage":5,"uses":218},{"base":"H2719","lemma":"חֶ֫רֶב","tr":"che·rev","gloss":"sword","lang":"h","inPassage":4,"uses":413},{"base":"H6680","lemma":"צָוָה","tr":"tsa·vah","gloss":"to command","lang":"h","inPassage":4,"uses":494},{"base":"H5221","lemma":"נָכָה","tr":"na·khah","gloss":"to smite","lang":"h","inPassage":4,"uses":500},{"base":"H8313","lemma":"שָׂרַף","tr":"sa·raph","gloss":"to burn","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":117},{"base":"H4872","lemma":"מֹשֶׁה","tr":"mo·sheh","gloss":"Moses","lang":"h","inPassage":4,"uses":766},{"base":"H5397","lemma":"נְשָׁמָה","tr":"ne·sha·mah","gloss":"breath","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":24},{"base":"H6310","lemma":"פֶּה","tr":"peh","gloss":"lip","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":498},{"base":"H2763","lemma":"חָרַם","tr":"cha·ram","gloss":"to devote","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":52}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"JOS","chapter":1,"verse":7,"verseEnd":7,"votes":6,"source":"both","text":"Above all, be strong and very courageous. Be careful to observe all the law that My servant Moses commanded you. Do not turn from it to the right or to the left, so that you may prosper wherever you go.","from":15},{"book":"EXO","chapter":34,"verse":11,"verseEnd":11,"votes":5,"source":"openbible","text":"Observe what I command you this day. I will drive out before you the Amorites, Canaanites, Hittites, Perizzites, Hivites, and Jebusites.","from":15},{"book":"EXO","chapter":34,"verse":13,"verseEnd":13,"votes":5,"source":"openbible","text":"Rather, you must tear down their altars, smash their sacred stones, and chop down their Asherah poles.","from":15},{"book":"DEU","chapter":7,"verse":2,"verseEnd":2,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"and when the LORD your God has delivered them over to you to defeat them, then you must devote them to complete destruction. Make no treaty with them and show them no mercy.","from":12},{"book":"DEU","chapter":7,"verse":2,"verseEnd":2,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"and when the LORD your God has delivered them over to you to defeat them, then you must devote them to complete destruction. Make no treaty with them and show them no mercy.","from":15},{"book":"DEU","chapter":20,"verse":16,"verseEnd":16,"votes":5,"source":"openbible","text":"However, in the cities of the nations that the LORD your God is giving you as an inheritance, you must not leave alive anything that breathes.","from":12},{"book":"DEU","chapter":20,"verse":17,"verseEnd":17,"votes":5,"source":"openbible","text":"For you must devote them to complete destruction—the Hittites, Amorites, Canaanites, Perizzites, Hivites, and Jebusites—as the LORD your God has commanded you,","from":12},{"book":"ACT","chapter":20,"verse":20,"verseEnd":20,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"I did not shrink back from declaring anything that was helpful to you as I taught you publicly and from house to house,","from":15}],"notes":[],"groups":[{"id":"exodus-family","title":"Moses and his circle","people":2}]},"16-23":{"people":[{"id":"israel-h3478","name":"Israel","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Isaac","count":6,"firstVerse":16},{"id":"joshua-h3091g","name":"Joshua","kind":"person","brief":"A judge","count":4,"firstVerse":16},{"id":"hivites-h2340","name":"Hivites","kind":"person","brief":"Canaanites","count":1,"firstVerse":19},{"id":"moses-h4872","name":"Moses","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Amram","count":2,"firstVerse":20},{"id":"anak-h6061","name":"Anak","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Arba","count":2,"firstVerse":21},{"id":"judah-h3063g","name":"Judah","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":1,"firstVerse":21}],"places":[{"id":"arabah-h6160g","name":"Arabah","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":16},{"id":"goshen-h1657h","name":"Goshen","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":16},{"id":"negeb-h5045g","name":"Negeb","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":16},{"id":"shephelah-h8219","name":"Shephelah","kind":"place","brief":"",